BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-08T07:25:05&endDate=2026-11-08T14:52:36">Disruption map.</a>\n\nBakerloo Line: No service between Queen's Park and Harrow & Wealdstone due to infrastructure damage at Harlesden and SEVERE DELAYS on the rest of the line while we fix a points failure at Elephant and Castle. Tickets are being accepted on London Buses and London Northwestern Railway. \r\n 
